{"speciesId":335,"names":{"fr":"Mangriff","es":"Zangoose","en":"Zangoose","ja":"ザングース"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"ruby","text":"Memories of battling its arch-rival SEVIPER are etched into every cell of ZANGOOSE’s body. This POKéMON adroitly dodges attacks with incredible agility."},{"language":"en","version":"sapphire","text":"ZANGOOSE usually stays on all fours, but when angered, it gets up on its hind legs and extends its claws. This POKéMON shares a bitter rivalry with SEVIPER that dates back over generations."},{"language":"en","version":"emerald","text":"When it battles, it stands on its hind legs and attacks with its sharply clawed forelegs. Its fur bristles if it encounters any SEVIPER."},{"language":"en","version":"firered","text":"If it comes across a SEVIPER, its fur bristles and it assumes its battle pose. Its sharp claws are its best weapon."},{"language":"en","version":"leafgreen","text":"If it comes across a SEVIPER, its fur bristles and it assumes its battle pose. Its sharp claws are its best weapon."},{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"It has feuded with SEVIPER for many generations. Its sharp claws are its biggest weapons."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"It has feuded with SEVIPER for many generations. Its sharp claws are its biggest weapons."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"It has feuded with SEVIPER for many generations. Its sharp claws are its biggest weapons."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"Its fur would all stand on end if it smelled a SEVIPER nearby. Its sharp claws tear up its foes."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"Its fur would all stand on end if it smelled a SEVIPER nearby. Its sharp claws tear up its foes."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"C’est le rival de Séviper depuis des générations. Ses griffes aiguisées sont son meilleur atout."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"It has feuded with Seviper for many generations. Its sharp claws are its biggest weapons."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"C’est le rival de Séviper depuis des générations. Ses griffes aiguisées sont son meilleur atout."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"It has feuded with Seviper for many generations. Its sharp claws are its biggest weapons."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"It’s Seviper’s archrival. To threaten those it encounters, it fans out the claws on its front paws."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"It’s Seviper’s archrival. To threaten those it encounters, it fans out the claws on its front paws."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"C’est le rival de Séviper depuis des générations. Ses griffes aiguisées sont son meilleur atout."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Hace muchos años que se enfrenta a Seviper. Su arma más eficaz son sus zarpas afiladas."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"It has feuded with Seviper for many generations. Its sharp claws are its biggest weapons."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"何世代にも 渡って ハブネークと 戦ってきた。 鋭い ツメが 最大の 武器。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Son poil se hérisse dès qu’il sent un Séviper. Il lacère ses ennemis avec ses griffes acérées."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Se le eriza todo el pelaje con solo oler un Seviper. Con sus afiladas zarpas puede rajar a sus enemigos."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"Its fur would all stand on end if it smelled a Seviper nearby. Its sharp claws tear up its foes."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"ハブネークの においを かぐ だけで 全身の 体毛が 逆立つ。 鋭い ツメが 敵を 切り裂く。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Chaque cellule du corps de Mangriff porte les stigmates de sa rivalité avec Séviper. Ce Pokémon est capable d’esquiver les attaques avec une agilité incroyable."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Los ecos del combate mantenido con su rival más feroz, Seviper, resuenan aún en cada célula de Zangoose. Este Pokémon esquiva los ataques con auténtica destreza."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Memories of battling its archrival Seviper are etched into every cell of Zangoose’s body. This Pokémon adroitly dodges attacks with incredible agility."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"宿敵 ハブネークとの 戦いの 記憶が 体中の 細胞に 刻み込まれている。 敏しょうな 身のこなしで 攻撃を かわす。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Mangriff est généralement à quatre pattes, mais lorsqu’il est en colère, il se lève sur ses pattes arrière et montre ses griffes. Ce Pokémon est l’ennemi juré de Séviper depuis plusieurs générations."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Zangoose suele caminar a cuatro patas, pero cuando se enfada se pone de pie sobre las traseras y saca las zarpas. Este Pokémon tiene desde hace varias generaciones una áspera rivalidad con Seviper."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Zangoose usually stays on all fours, but when angered, it gets up on its hind legs and extends its claws. This Pokémon shares a bitter rivalry with Seviper that dates back over generations."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"普段は ４本足で 行動するが 怒ると 後足で 立ち 前足の ツメが 飛び出す。 ハブネークとは 先祖から 続く ライバルだ。"}],"varieties":[{"id":335,"moves":[{"name":"mega-punch","learns":[[6,"tutor",0],[7,"tutor",0]]},{"name":"fire-punch","learns":[[6,"tutor",0],[9,"tutor",0],[10,"tutor",0],[14,"tutor",0],[16,"tutor",0],[18,"tutor",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"ice-punch","learns":[[6,"tutor",0],[9,"tutor",0],[10,"tutor",0],[14,"tutor",0],[16,"tutor",0],[18,"tutor",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"thunder-punch","learns":[[6,"tutor",0],[9,"tutor",0],[10,"tutor",0],[14,"tutor",0],[16,"tutor",0],[18,"tutor",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"scratch","learns":[[5,"level-up",1],[6,"level-up",1],[7,"level-up",1],[8,"level-up",1],[9,"level-up",1],[10,"level-up",1],[11,"level-up",1],[12,"level-up",1],[13,"level-up",1],[14,"level-up",1],[15,"level-up",1],[16,"level-up",1],[17,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",1],[23,"level-up",1],[25,"le